From c8c4ccb11c2717f1ccb0058ab17110e80b8abd9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:26:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] Pimax pages refresh after Preferences, debounced saves,
 live options

- Preferences closing rebuilds the Pimax pages (the eye page only when no
  tool is running), so every row shows the current value.
- Pimax page edits are saved 0.5 s after the last change (flushed on quit).
- Live options (IPD offset, view cant, eye calibration and flip, stick dead
  zone) are written to $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/pimax-p3c/settings.json for the
  running driver and no longer ask for a restart.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
